          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Size a CPAP battery for the settings you will actually sleep with on battery power. With the humidifier off and a DC cable, a roughly 300Wh station like the EcoFlow River 3 Plus covers a night with margin and makes an excellent bedside backup.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Fly with a sub-100Wh dedicated pack like the Medistrom Pilot-24 Lite, step up to a 1kWh station for multi-day outages, and keep any generator outdoors and charging batteries by day. Confirm every cable and setting with your CPAP maker, DME supplier and doctor.
          </p>
